WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Addon</c></b>

2
00:01:41.580 --> 00:01:44.210
<b>Seppuku</b>

3
00:02:54.360 --> 00:03:01.790
<b>Wano Country</b>

4
00:03:02.910 --> 00:03:05.920
[TOWNSPERSON A]
Come
and get your freshwater clams!

5
00:03:05.920 --> 00:03:07.750
[TOWNSPERSON B]
Move outta my way!

6
00:03:11.630 --> 00:03:13.380
[TOWNSPERSON C]
Come one,
come all, don't be shy!

7
00:03:13.380 --> 00:03:15.510
Our famous Flower Udon is waiting for you!

8
00:03:50.590 --> 00:03:54.840
[CARPENTER A]
We're short-handed here.
Could you lend me some help?

9
00:03:54.840 --> 00:03:57.340
[CARPENTER B]
Hey! Carry the other end!

10
00:03:57.970 --> 00:04:00.220
Bah! Hey you, Greenhorn!

11
00:04:00.220 --> 00:04:02.510
Yeah, the new guy!

12
00:04:02.510 --> 00:04:06.230
Tell me, is this your work up here?
Well, answer me, boy!

13
00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.310
You bet! Is there a problem?

14
00:04:09.730 --> 00:04:11.270
Or do you just wanna shout?

15
00:04:11.730 --> 00:04:15.490
Now listen up! You fool!

16
00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:17.570
Your woodwork's utterly perfect!

17
00:04:18.320 --> 00:04:21.430
Nice job! You damn fool!

18
00:04:23.700 --> 00:04:26.410
Of course, it's perfect! Because I...

19
00:04:26.790 --> 00:04:28.290
You must maintain your role!

20
00:04:28.470 --> 00:04:30.190
[gasps]

21
00:04:31.480 --> 00:04:32.230
Huh?

22
00:04:32.380 --> 00:04:34.380
Gotcha.

23
00:04:34.880 --> 00:04:36.760
I'm happy to hear it then.

24
00:04:36.760 --> 00:04:38.840
Thank you, sir!

25
00:04:39.970 --> 00:04:42.720
That guy's an asshole!

26
00:04:42.720 --> 00:04:45.800
<b>Franosuke



Carpenter</b>

27
00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.440
[ribbits]

28
00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:48.770
[USOPP]
Step right up, folks!

29
00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.730
C'mon! Gather 'round everyone!

30
00:04:51.730 --> 00:04:55.690
[USOPP]
Here's an ordinary sheet of paper,
no gimmicks or setup here!

31
00:04:55.690 --> 00:04:58.070
One sheet becomes two!

32
00:04:58.070 --> 00:05:01.860
Two sheets become four! But it doesn't end
there, folks! Four sheets become eight!

33
00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:07.250
Eight to sixteen, and then thirty-two to sixty-four!
Are you following me? Hi-yah! Hi-yah!

34
00:05:09.790 --> 00:05:12.380
And just like the cherry blossom petals

35
00:05:12.380 --> 00:05:19.630
or snowfall at Wano's dusk, you, too, can make
a flurry of paper, with little to no effort!

36
00:05:28.680 --> 00:05:33.560
Take witness! I shall now demonstrate
how razor-sharp this sword truly is!

37
00:05:33.560 --> 00:05:35.690
Ha! Watch as I graze my skin!

38
00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:40.130
Behold! A laceration!

39
00:05:40.130 --> 00:05:41.290
[townspeople gasp]

40
00:05:41.380 --> 00:05:44.210
[townspeople murmuring]

41
00:05:46.120 --> 00:05:48.370
Now if I may direct your attention here!

42
00:05:48.640 --> 00:05:52.210
What I'm holding in my palm is toad oil!

43
00:05:52.670 --> 00:05:56.340
Just apply a dab and watch
what it does to my wound.

44
00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:01.170
[USOPP]
Voila!

45
00:06:01.510 --> 00:06:04.090
Look! You see that?

46
00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:06.720
A mere touch patches it up!

47
00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.760
It's all healed! And no bleeding!

48
00:06:09.390 --> 00:06:11.850
This special toad oil hails from the East Blue!

49
00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.940
Now, do I have any takers?

50
00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:15.730
[TOWNSPERSON O]
I'll take some!

51
00:06:15.730 --> 00:06:18.190
Wise folks, if I do say so!

52
00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:22.070
Now! Let's make one line and don't shove!

53
00:06:22.030 --> 00:06:25.450
<b>Usohachi



Toad Oil

Salesman</b>

54
00:06:33.050 --> 00:06:40.320
[UMI]
Ooh, irresistible! Yes!
Yes, that's the stuff right there!

55
00:06:42.130 --> 00:06:43.630
Raise your arm a bit more!

56
00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.550
And don't forget to keep those hips low!

57
00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:49.850
Yes, ma'am.

58
00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:55.390
[UMI]
What you're hoping to achieve is nigh
on impossible, so you need to push yourself!

59
00:06:55.390 --> 00:07:04.180
Not just any old gal receives a summons to the shogun's
chamber, let alone in such a short amount of time! Ow, ow, ow!

60
00:07:04.200 --> 00:07:10.330
Oh, oh, oh, oh! That's it!
Keep it up, baby! Yeah!

61
00:07:13.960 --> 00:07:15.120
Yes, ma'am.

62
00:07:15.790 --> 00:07:19.920
<b>Orobi



Geisha</b>

63
00:07:31.010 --> 00:07:33.140
[Zoro sighs]
That's some good sake.

64
00:07:35.140 --> 00:07:39.180
<b>Zorojuro



Ronin</b>

65
00:07:39.730 --> 00:07:40.940
[ZORO]
I'll come back soon.

66
00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:42.440
[TOWNSPERSON Q]
Thank you
for your business!

67
00:07:50.370 --> 00:07:52.830
Well, look at that. Beautiful.

68
00:07:53.730 --> 00:07:55.520
I should buy another round

69
00:08:12.930 --> 00:08:15.270
[gasps]
No!

70
00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.320
[TSUJIGIRO]
Move!

71
00:08:25.400 --> 00:08:27.320
The smell of blood?

72
00:08:27.990 --> 00:08:28.900
What's the rush?

73
00:08:30.910 --> 00:08:32.990
You're smelling pretty good there, bud.

74
00:08:33.620 --> 00:08:37.540
Is that blood-scented perfume on you?
Where'd ya pick that up?

75
00:08:47.880 --> 00:08:50.800
"Arrest"

76
00:08:50.800 --> 00:08:54.510
Hey, the killer just ran off that way.

77
00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:57.140
You're under arrest! So stay right there!

78
00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:59.200
[POLICE B]
You're the murderer!

79
00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.310
[POLICE C]
Don't resist!

80
00:09:00.310 --> 00:09:01.480
[ZORO]
I wasn't.

81
00:09:01.480 --> 00:09:07.150
[POLICE]
We'll be taking you in, slasher! Don't
move! Surrender! It's over. Drop the swords!

82
00:09:10.030 --> 00:09:12.530
Since apparently I'm in some trouble,

83
00:09:12.990 --> 00:09:16.290
I'll have to defend myself. Okay, let's do this!

84
00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:18.690
You must maintain your role!

85
00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:22.210
[KIN'EMON]
Listen, closely. You are

86
00:09:22.210 --> 00:09:23.580
in the Land of Wano.

87
00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.130
We have a Shogun.

88
00:09:26.130 --> 00:09:29.530
Remember his name. Kurozumi Orochi!

89
00:09:30.090 --> 00:09:36.390
Do keep in mind that any officials
who do his bidding all have ties to the Emperor Kaido, himself!

90
00:09:36.390 --> 00:09:40.310
Thus, these men are rogues!
Arrogant and corrupt.

91
00:09:41.060 --> 00:09:45.820
That's why, if you harm them,
Kaido will be the first to hear of it!

92
00:09:46.190 --> 00:09:51.110
We must not allow our existence to be known
until our allies can assemble with us once more.

93
00:09:51.110 --> 00:09:54.450
Only then can preparations begin.

94
00:09:54.950 --> 00:09:58.160
It is essential that
you blend in seamlessly with the locals.

95
00:09:58.540 --> 00:10:01.710
You'll live quietly and go about your business.

96
00:10:01.710 --> 00:10:05.750
It is your duty! Keep the peace! Am I clear?

97
00:10:08.920 --> 00:10:10.710
Guess I got no choice.

98
00:10:10.710 --> 00:10:12.090
On my honor.

99
00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.760
I surrender.

100
00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.180
[POLICE D]
Go!

101
00:10:15.180 --> 00:10:18.930
– Grab him!
– Grab him!

102
00:10:25.440 --> 00:10:29.780
[TOWNSPERSON T]
The menacing scourge
who was terrorizing our town is now in custody!

103
00:10:29.780 --> 00:10:33.860
Our brave magistrate
has finally apprehended that scoundrel!

104
00:10:33.860 --> 00:10:36.740
As punishment, he's being
sentenced to seppuku!

105
00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:39.410
You can read about the rest
of the details right in here!

106
00:10:39.410 --> 00:10:41.450
[TOWNSPERSON F]
Good riddance!

107
00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:44.290
He's the man that murdered
my poor husband!

108
00:10:44.290 --> 00:10:46.130
What a relief!

109
00:10:46.130 --> 00:10:50.250
I was worried this place would never be safe
again after the three recent slashings!

110
00:10:53.880 --> 00:10:56.970
'Scuse me! You mind if I get one of those?

111
00:10:56.970 --> 00:10:58.180
[TOWNSPERSON T]
Sure! Here ya go!

112
00:10:59.350 --> 00:11:02.520
[Usopp gasps]
Z-Zorojuro?
"The Slasher, Zorojuro"

113
00:11:10.610 --> 00:11:14.030
[TSUJIGIRO]
So your name is Zorojuro, is it?

114
00:11:15.110 --> 00:11:19.490
Your carnage has stricken fear
into the hearts of our populace.

115
00:11:19.490 --> 00:11:25.280
If you do the honorable thing and commit
seppuku, our town shall be peaceful again.

116
00:11:26.080 --> 00:11:29.250
Well, look at that! How funny.

117
00:11:29.790 --> 00:11:33.010
Apparently, you're a grave robber as well?

118
00:11:33.670 --> 00:11:35.880
Twenty-three years ago,

119
00:11:36.430 --> 00:11:39.800
amidst a pirate upheaval,
the whereabouts of a

120
00:11:39.800 --> 00:11:44.180
legendary blade and the corpse
of its owner, Ryuma, went missing.

121
00:11:44.180 --> 00:11:47.730
[TSUJIGIRO]
The name
of his famed blade was Shusui.

122
00:11:47.730 --> 00:11:52.690
Legend has it that Ryuma chopped
the head off a giant dragon with this sword.

123
00:11:53.190 --> 00:11:58.060
And now I hold it in my hands. Incredible.

124
00:11:58.990 --> 00:12:02.370
Just how old are you? I'm curious.

125
00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:06.580
That infamous grave robbery took place
over two decades ago.

126
00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:09.540
You seem a bit young to have done that.

127
00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:12.290
Did you steal it from the thief?

128
00:12:15.340 --> 00:12:16.970
It doesn't matter.

129
00:12:16.970 --> 00:12:21.390
I possess the sword now.
And what a fine treasure it is!

130
00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.940
Hm? Sir!

131
00:12:27.940 --> 00:12:31.310
The time is upon us, Zorojuro, are you ready?

132
00:12:34.210 --> 00:12:36.740
Huh? What gives?

133
00:12:37.240 --> 00:12:39.530
This blade's got no hilt.

134
00:12:42.870 --> 00:12:44.160
Your mightiness.

135
00:12:44.160 --> 00:12:48.540
There's no need for one
as it's not a weapon forged for battle.

136
00:12:48.540 --> 00:12:52.170
The knife's short and lacks a handle.
It's on purpose, you imbecile!

137
00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:56.590
Are you making jest of the situation
in your final moments?

138
00:12:57.170 --> 00:13:02.510
If you have any pride as a samurai, admit
your guilt and make amends with your death.

139
00:13:02.850 --> 00:13:05.600
I'll make sure you don't suffer in your passing.

140
00:13:06.720 --> 00:13:09.020
It is my duty!

141
00:13:28.620 --> 00:13:30.330
In that case,

142
00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.460
farewell.

143
00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:36.840
[TSUJIGIRO]
Don't cry like a baby.

144
00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:42.050
When a samurai meets his ends,
he needs to do the honorable thing.

145
00:13:42.590 --> 00:13:44.640
Your guilt is certain

146
00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:46.390
and your crimes were unspeakable.

147
00:13:46.970 --> 00:13:50.600
You are receiving an honorable death
that you hardly deserve.

148
00:13:50.970 --> 00:13:54.520
Take pride in your seppuku.

149
00:14:10.790 --> 00:14:13.330
I can still smell the scent of blood.

150
00:14:16.920 --> 00:14:18.300
It's from you.

151
00:14:19.880 --> 00:14:21.380
You're the slasher!

152
00:14:49.120 --> 00:14:52.580
I had to. Sorry, Kin'emon.

153
00:15:31.370 --> 00:15:34.330
So we made it then. Wano.

154
00:15:51.310 --> 00:15:53.640
[LUFFY]
Where is everybody?

155
00:15:54.680 --> 00:15:56.600
Lemme think.

156
00:15:57.350 --> 00:16:00.560
What happened to us again? Let's see.

157
00:16:05.050 --> 00:16:07.900
[KOMURASAKI]
Hah! Ha-ah!

158
00:16:08.030 --> 00:16:10.320
[SAMURAI GUARD H]
Go! Strike him down!

159
00:17:16.890 --> 00:17:18.100
What the heck?

160
00:17:30.650 --> 00:17:31.410
[Luffy gasps]
Hey!

161
00:17:31.570 --> 00:17:34.180
[Komachiyo growling]

162
00:17:35.240 --> 00:17:36.290
[LUFFY]
You jerk!

163
00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:38.790
You better not have broken our ship!

164
00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:42.660
[gasps]
It's a giant dog!

165
00:17:45.040 --> 00:17:47.710
Wait, or is it a boar?

166
00:18:05.020 --> 00:18:07.980
<b>A Baboon</b>

167
00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.990
Why's that ape have a sword?

168
00:18:15.990 --> 00:18:18.740
I guess this really is the Land of Wano.

169
00:18:25.750 --> 00:18:30.460
Wild sword monkey versus wild dog thing?
Wano's a pretty crazy place!

170
00:18:58.410 --> 00:19:00.160
Hey, you two!

171
00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:03.460
You can fight each other all
you want, just don't do it near my ship!

172
00:19:13.090 --> 00:19:16.220
Let's see. What was I doing again?

173
00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:25.060
[LUFFY]
When we climbed up the waterfall,
we saw land for a split second,

174
00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:28.900
but then we got sucked
into that big whirlpool!

175
00:19:28.900 --> 00:19:30.610
What's happening?

176
00:19:30.610 --> 00:19:33.240
I think that the tide is running
in reverse somehow.

177
00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:36.280
Just hang in there, Sunny!

178
00:19:36.500 --> 00:19:38.910
[gasps]

179
00:19:38.910 --> 00:19:41.160
Don't worry, Nami. I got you.

180
00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.990
I appreciate it, Sanji!

181
00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:45.620
Oh, it's my pleasure, I assure you!

182
00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:46.920
[CARROT]
Sanji!

183
00:19:46.920 --> 00:19:48.330
Grab onto me!

184
00:19:48.330 --> 00:19:51.740
Good! Now, I'm gonna jump us to safety!

185
00:19:52.800 --> 00:19:53.800
You ready?

186
00:19:53.800 --> 00:19:55.590
[CHOPPER]
Sanji, wait!

187
00:19:57.590 --> 00:20:00.430
[sobs]
You gotta take me with you!

188
00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:01.930
Hang on, Chobro!

189
00:20:01.930 --> 00:20:03.430
I got a weight limit here!

190
00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:06.850
C'mon now! You can't leave me behind!

191
00:20:07.310 --> 00:20:09.310
You're on your own for this one, bud.

192
00:20:10.560 --> 00:20:13.070
How could you?

193
00:20:13.530 --> 00:20:14.860
I'm just kidding.

194
00:20:14.860 --> 00:20:16.400
I've always got your back, Chopper.

195
00:20:16.400 --> 00:20:17.820
[CHOPPER]
Sanji!

196
00:20:20.120 --> 00:20:22.830
[Brook laughs]
I hope
you all saved room for one more!

197
00:20:23.950 --> 00:20:25.580
[Brook laughs]
Let's bring it in!

198
00:20:25.580 --> 00:20:27.460
Love ya!

199
00:20:27.790 --> 00:20:30.040
No offense, but you're kinda pokey!

200
00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:32.880
You're way too close!
Brook, stop being gross!

201
00:20:33.300 --> 00:20:36.110
[LUFFY]
Hey! Use my belly
to bounce. Sound good?

202
00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:39.090
It's a plan!

203
00:20:41.280 --> 00:20:43.160
[all gasp]

204
00:20:43.510 --> 00:20:44.720
See you soon, Luffy!

205
00:20:44.720 --> 00:20:48.120
[LUFFY]
Yeah! I'll be right behind you guys!

206
00:20:50.690 --> 00:20:52.940
Alrighty! You be good, Sunny!

207
00:20:52.940 --> 00:20:55.980
Okay? I promise to come find you
when it's safer!

208
00:21:01.950 --> 00:21:04.410
Here I go!

209
00:21:07.250 --> 00:21:09.120
The octopus?

210
00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:13.790
What do you even want from me? Huh?

211
00:21:13.790 --> 00:21:17.800
Stupid octopus!

212
00:21:30.980 --> 00:21:34.060
Oh yeah. That must be why
I woke up on this beach.

213
00:21:34.770 --> 00:21:37.780
Am I still above the waterfall?
Or is this below it?

214
00:21:37.780 --> 00:21:40.700
I can't tell if this is Wano or not.

215
00:21:47.950 --> 00:21:48.830
Crap!

216
00:21:48.830 --> 00:21:50.370
The Vivre Card!

217
00:21:50.370 --> 00:21:51.440
[Luffy groans]

218
00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.500
Where did it go?

219
00:21:53.500 --> 00:21:55.090
Is it in the sea?

220
00:21:55.670 --> 00:21:57.960
Dammit!

221
00:21:58.350 --> 00:21:59.700
[Luffy sighs]

222
00:22:01.340 --> 00:22:02.590
[LUFFY]
Oh, well.

223
00:22:02.590 --> 00:22:03.550
Whatever.

224
00:22:03.550 --> 00:22:05.640
[OTAMA]
Stop!

225
00:22:05.640 --> 00:22:10.390
Lemme go already!
I didn't say nothin' like that!

226
00:22:10.390 --> 00:22:12.940
And gimme back my rice, too!

227
00:22:13.350 --> 00:22:15.560
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
I
know what I heard.

228
00:22:16.230 --> 00:22:21.320
The Kozuki Clan is gonna come back!
And then you'll pay!

229
00:22:21.320 --> 00:22:22.950
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
You traitor.

230
00:22:24.240 --> 00:22:28.160
You've chosen to ally yourself
with a bunch of villains, have you?

231
00:22:28.160 --> 00:22:30.000
That's a serious crime and

232
00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:32.870
there'll be no mercy!
As punishment, we'll either sell you

233
00:22:32.870 --> 00:22:33.960
to a brothel or toss you in jail.

234
00:22:34.540 --> 00:22:35.710
But, mister!

235
00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:37.460
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
Aw,
shut your trap!

236
00:22:37.880 --> 00:22:39.840
[MASSUI]
Enough. We've got a job to do.

237
00:22:42.630 --> 00:22:44.470
Look! There's a ship on the beach!

238
00:22:44.470 --> 00:22:46.550
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
Just one survivor?

239
00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:49.640
[MASSUI]
The baboon's still battling the lion-dog?
I thought he was at least strong enough

240
00:22:49.640 --> 00:22:52.060
to take care of that puny thing!

241
00:22:53.560 --> 00:22:55.230
[Otama gasps]
Komachiyo?

242
00:22:56.810 --> 00:22:58.170
[barks]

243
00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:01.190
Okay, guys, knock it off already.

244
00:23:01.190 --> 00:23:03.860
There it is! We found the ship, sir!

245
00:23:03.860 --> 00:23:05.490
Looks like the report was correct.

246
00:23:05.910 --> 00:23:07.320
[HAWKINS]
Can you see its crew?

247
00:23:07.320 --> 00:23:08.620
[MASSUI]
Just one man.

248
00:23:08.990 --> 00:23:10.370
How interesting.

249
00:23:10.370 --> 00:23:13.120
[MASSUI]
We'll knock him out
and bring him back with us!

250
00:23:13.120 --> 00:23:15.710
I think he'll make for a good laborer, sir!

251
00:23:21.000 --> 00:23:23.380
Heheh. That's a good boy, just stay right there.
Heheh. That's a good boy, just stay right there.

252
00:23:24.760 --> 00:23:29.300
When you wake up, we'll have
a surprise for you: a lifetime of slavery!

253
00:23:44.610 --> 00:23:45.530
[PIRATE]
What the hell?

254
00:23:50.910 --> 00:23:52.700
Who just attacked me?

255
00:23:52.700 --> 00:23:54.250
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
You bastard!

256
00:23:59.080 --> 00:24:00.790
Huh?

257
00:24:01.800 --> 00:24:03.800
[HAWKINS]
Hey. What's going on?

258
00:24:03.800 --> 00:24:07.690
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
Uh. Nothing, sir!

259
00:24:22.150 --> 00:24:24.860
This beach is popular, huh?

260
00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:26.740
Damn.

261
00:24:27.360 --> 00:24:28.990
You stupid baboon!

262
00:24:28.990 --> 00:24:31.910
Don't just stand there!
You gotta do something!

263
00:24:32.280 --> 00:24:33.990
Forget the mutt for now!

264
00:24:33.990 --> 00:24:35.580
Catch that guy!

265
00:24:35.580 --> 00:24:38.490
[screeches]

266
00:24:40.580 --> 00:24:42.920
[BEAST PIRATE WAITER A]
Actually, you know what?

267
00:24:42.920 --> 00:24:44.420
Go ahead and kill him!

268
00:25:15.990 --> 00:25:17.410
Do you want something?

269
00:25:47.280 --> 00:25:48.230
Heh. Good!

270
00:25:48.230 --> 00:25:51.360
Now, you two play nice and get along, okay!

271
00:25:54.450 --> 00:25:57.200
[Beast Pirate waiter A groans]
Why
the hell are you bowing your head like that?

272
00:25:57.200 --> 00:25:59.790
It's just one measly pirate, you fool!

273
00:26:13.510 --> 00:26:17.680
You miserable brat! I'll make you pay!

274
00:26:17.680 --> 00:26:18.260
[Otama screams]

275
00:26:18.260 --> 00:26:20.310
You are gonna die for that one!

276
00:26:20.600 --> 00:26:21.390
[screams]

277
00:26:21.390 --> 00:26:23.770
There's no use running from me!

278
00:26:23.770 --> 00:26:25.610
I'm really sorry, mister!

279
00:26:32.900 --> 00:26:34.280
[OTAMA]
I surrender!

280
00:26:34.610 --> 00:26:36.240
I surrender!

281
00:26:37.530 --> 00:26:39.740
What are you doing? Weirdo.

282
00:26:39.740 --> 00:26:42.120
[OTAMA]
I said I surrender!

283
00:26:42.120 --> 00:26:44.500
This is the surrender pose!

284
00:26:44.750 --> 00:26:48.090
<b>Otama</b>

285
00:26:49.090 --> 00:26:51.420
I wasn't gonna do anything to you though!

286
00:26:51.420 --> 00:26:54.380
Really? Do you mean it, sir?

287
00:26:54.800 --> 00:26:56.260
Yeah, of course.

288
00:26:56.260 --> 00:26:58.220
Okay, then maybe,

289
00:26:58.720 --> 00:27:03.560
if you're not gonna kill me, could I ask
for a favor? An itty-bitty one?

290
00:27:03.560 --> 00:27:05.230
It's my only chance!

291
00:27:06.190 --> 00:27:08.730
[LUFFY]
What is it? Tell me.

292
00:27:08.730 --> 00:27:10.440
[OTAMA]
Alright. Let's do it.

293
00:27:10.440 --> 00:27:11.900
[LUFFY]
Huh? Do what?

294
00:27:12.240 --> 00:27:15.160
[TAMA]
Kibi Dan, go!

295
00:27:18.410 --> 00:27:20.160
Okay! Here you go!

296
00:27:21.080 --> 00:27:23.080
Huh?! You pulled your cheek off!

297
00:27:27.630 --> 00:27:29.340
Take it! This is for you!

298
00:27:39.050 --> 00:27:41.010
What are you even trying to do?

299
00:27:55.530 --> 00:27:56.740
Now shake.

300
00:28:02.490 --> 00:28:05.210
[Luffy gasps]
You just tamed
that huge ape monster!

301
00:28:05.210 --> 00:28:06.960
I did it! I did it!

302
00:28:07.330 --> 00:28:12.920
I finally made pals with the mountain baboon!
Now he'll stop causing trouble for me!

303
00:28:12.920 --> 00:28:16.090
Yay!

304
00:28:16.090 --> 00:28:18.220
You're some kinda power-user, huh?

305
00:28:18.220 --> 00:28:21.220
And it looks like it's a pretty handy one, too!

306
00:28:21.220 --> 00:28:22.280
[giggles]

307
00:28:25.520 --> 00:28:26.680
Attaboy!

308
00:28:26.680 --> 00:28:29.020
You're our buddy now!

309
00:28:32.230 --> 00:28:33.730
[Otama giggles]
Good monkey!

310
00:28:33.730 --> 00:28:35.400
[LUFFY]
Is that your dog?

311
00:28:35.400 --> 00:28:36.820
[OTAMA]
Yup!

312
00:28:36.820 --> 00:28:38.860
His name is Komachiyo!

313
00:28:40.280 --> 00:28:42.410
Hey, Komachiyo!

314
00:28:42.410 --> 00:28:43.530
I'm Luffy!

315
00:28:43.530 --> 00:28:45.540
Now let's be friends from here on out!

316
00:28:49.580 --> 00:28:52.920
[Otama giggles]
Oh, by the way,
my name's Otama.

317
00:28:52.920 --> 00:28:54.840
Alrighty then, Otama!

318
00:28:54.840 --> 00:28:56.260
It's real nice to meetcha!

319
00:28:56.260 --> 00:28:58.050
It's nice to meet you, too!

320
00:28:58.050 --> 00:28:58.720
[LUFFY]
Oh yeah!

321
00:28:58.720 --> 00:29:02.930
I got a quick question.
I need to know if I made it to Wano or not.

322
00:29:03.390 --> 00:29:05.060
"Made it to Wano"?

323
00:29:06.470 --> 00:29:09.810
Well, yeah! This is the Land of Wano!

324
00:29:10.140 --> 00:29:14.020
And the beach that we're
on now is in a region called Kuri!

325
00:29:14.020 --> 00:29:15.400
Got it, Big Bro?

326
00:29:15.400 --> 00:29:18.530
Yeah, it's great! I wasn't sure!

327
00:29:19.320 --> 00:29:22.910
I finally made it to the Land of Wano!

328
00:29:23.240 --> 00:29:25.620
I'm comin' for you, Kaido!

329
00:29:25.620 --> 00:29:27.290
Wait, "Big Bro"?

330
00:29:27.700 --> 00:29:28.410
The heck?

331
00:29:28.410 --> 00:29:30.620
When did I become your big brother, huh?

332
00:29:31.960 --> 00:29:34.090
A big brother's a big brother.

333
00:29:34.420 --> 00:29:35.920
What's that even mean?

334
00:29:35.920 --> 00:29:37.670
Well, whatever, I guess.

335
00:29:37.670 --> 00:29:40.260
It just makes sense! Big Bro!

336
00:29:53.980 --> 00:29:57.440
[SAMURAI GUARD B]
Zorojuro!
You've committed a serious crime!

337
00:30:07.990 --> 00:30:09.700
You'll pay, slasher!

338
00:30:09.700 --> 00:30:11.790
You still refuse to admit your guilt?

339
00:30:16.380 --> 00:30:16.950
[ZORO]
Hm?

340
00:30:31.810 --> 00:30:33.640
He wields three swords?

341
00:30:33.640 --> 00:30:35.060
What the hell?

342
00:30:42.570 --> 00:30:44.110
What's he doing?

343
00:30:44.110 --> 00:30:50.500
[ZORO]
Tatsu Maki!

344
00:31:23.320 --> 00:31:26.820
[ZORO]
If nothing else, Wano has
some nice weather.

345
00:31:27.700 --> 00:31:31.450
The men at Kuri Beach.
We lost communication with them.

346
00:31:31.450 --> 00:31:34.620
I speculate that someone
may have taken them down!

347
00:31:35.000 --> 00:31:36.830
[HAWKINS PIRATE B]
While there's
no trace of a ship,

348
00:31:38.000 --> 00:31:40.130
Your thoughts, Boss? What should we do?

349
00:31:49.510 --> 00:31:52.010
Don't let word get back to Kaido.

350
00:31:55.020 --> 00:31:56.850
[HAWKINS]
I'll take care of it.
